      </div>
    </header>

    <p class="atlas-error" data-atlas-error hidden><a class="btn" href={u("/datasets")}><span>The map could not load. The data is still available on the datasets page.</span><span class="btn-arrow" aria-hidden="true">→</span></a></p>

    <div class="atlas-body">
